Date: Fri, 25 Sep 2026 17:17:23 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/4] v117.2: server-mode fixes found running real apps through
 v117.1

- proxy run/state folders: 0770 instead of 2770 (RestrictSUIDSGID refused the setgid chmod: RUNNER_EXCEPTION)
- images are built from a copy with ordinary file modes; the library's 0640 files made nginx answer 403
- a folder of Python modules with no packaging file is recognised as an app

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01AQwycJi8eqTo6GVPCjUZqa
